# DevTools Internals

Coming soon — this page explains the internals of Reactor's
devtools: how the in-app dev menu observes the runtime, the
reconcile-highlight overlay's draw cycle, the layout-cost overlay
(ETW-sourced, attributed by spatial bounds), the MCP server protocol
surface, and how `dotnet watch` integrates. See
[the AI Author Skill](../../_pipeline/ai-author-skill.md) for the
planned surface.

Until then, [Dev Tooling](dev-tooling.md) covers the surface usage.
